'''Entei ex''' (Japanese: '''エンテイex''' ''Entei ex'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

